            <div xml:id="m-8525fffe-4913-4c2f-8fa0-7206b7bf6780">
              <lg xml:id="m-7d23a381-5973-4e01-865d-03dbcbcd9efe">
                <l xml:id="m-a35a175e-161b-46df-beae-a581fc71b95e" facs="#m-af354af9-3a08-4dc5-83c0-482c993077e2" label="ambiguous">Dixit Dominus. 3. a: g. — 4. E, A, A".</l><l xml:id="m-d147d86c-cee3-4777-84eb-46be88c54418" facs="#m-514cd3f3-07cb-487c-becf-125bf33fb3e6" label="ambiguous">130</l><l xml:id="m-57982ad0-3701-488b-a6ea-e40f66673530" facs="#m-42796840-16fe-40f1-86d7-518fe5381946" label="lyrics-like">6. Dóminus a déxtris túis, * confrégit in die frae súde réges.</l><l xml:id="m-dd61537d-22fb-41c1-8cea-bfa69754185e" facs="#m-9e69b5e5-7b72-4b9c-8efa-9f9f3e226cd5" label="lyrics-like">7. Judicábit in natiónibus, implébit ruinas: * conquassábit cápita in</l><l xml:id="m-946615b9-251e-49e3-9959-50ec121360fd" facs="#m-0db09d0b-1dd5-4371-8353-68304e005b0f" label="lyrics-like">térra mustórum.</l><l xml:id="m-de475ae2-bd9a-4e3a-89c3-01396f333018" facs="#m-96abef21-f06e-4905-aede-1f2f204b60f1" label="lyrics-like">8. De torrénte in via bibet:“proptérea exaltábit cáput.</l><l xml:id="m-1699d75a-9d1f-45fc-a985-04fb865cf236" facs="#m-5edeeb59-5023-4060-9468-da9be8faddc1" label="lyrics-like">9. Glória Pâtri, et Fillo, *et Spiritu! Sancto.</l><l xml:id="m-7092f6ce-1184-4aeb-8b43-a81561ae7df5" facs="#m-25854896-235a-4280-a8ed-b96365f5b419" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut érat in principio, et núne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-627eb60d-0b10-4bb3-b05b-fdd801a73bc3" facs="#m-4b1f13fb-2cdf-4c79-90b1-cf10020529fe" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-121cdba5-e489-418f-8597-730d6a1d9f23" facs="#m-0122216a-4001-4092-9261-fce1801b148f" label="ambiguous">Tone 8. a", g.</l><l xml:id="m-89151a31-e2de-4ec9-b441-7e009860f028" facs="#m-8e1367aa-998d-41e9-9f3c-94cc4feef07a" label="text-like">Mediant ofz accents (with an extra Endings of I accent with a prepar¬¬</l><l xml:id="m-334fc43a-0d10-462d-aaaf-5a78c97598a8" facs="#m-e88aac42-8621-489a-a23c-aba7bbab4337" label="text-like">note in anticipation of the accent in tory syllables.</l><l xml:id="m-eb6dc27e-4d2a-4982-9ed4-c8995739d3ad" facs="#m-3e134d71-f8b8-4a29-9bb8-b995378787ed" label="ambiguous">dactylic cadences).</l><l xml:id="m-2a1c576e-316a-41e5-9fe7-bb1e1e725897" facs="#m-451586ea-9c7c-46ab-86fc-5cacb4423463" label="ambiguous">a</l><l xml:id="m-901c01c1-1b8d-40f5-94f8-6b27f2df15de" facs="#m-5a9e5be1-eb0c-4987-8086-3179eaede579" label="lyrics-like">1. Di-xit Dóminus Dómino</l><l xml:id="m-c9cf5938-ff17-45b7-b793-ea270e9ca2d3" facs="#m-63ee5f73-8721-48b5-ba39-b70529ea73c1" label="lyrics-like">mé-o:* Séde a dextris mé¬ is.</l><l xml:id="m-6524bc2b-8436-4d38-b0a3-2c6c8bba7972" facs="#m-81cf4991-8292-44f2-85e0-dfc7c1f3b36b" label="ambiguous">8</l><l xml:id="m-d7a1d8ee-849b-444c-9046-f432bc6b9ec5" facs="#m-dce0d97b-a714-4ae8-b869-c525353d389a" label="lyrics-like">or: mé¬ is.</l><l xml:id="m-d9b2e82a-05cb-400a-8a17-1d1480150b26" facs="#m-3e3dca43-2158-42e2-8642-c05868e3da42" label="lyrics-like">2. Donec pónam inimicos túos, * scabéllum pédum tuórum.</l><l xml:id="m-52905e40-81fc-4a3e-9711-156199a5bbf1" facs="#m-da129bbc-7b69-4f75-8756-4251f7ebb70f" label="lyrics-like">3. Virgam virtútis túae emittet Dóminus ex Sion:“domináre in</l><l xml:id="m-12b25fe0-231f-423b-80c7-0cd8a5514980" facs="#m-21891408-70f6-4cac-9c7b-157bbf86119d" label="lyrics-like">médio inimicórum taórum.</l><l xml:id="m-8fa80772-725f-4f0e-9795-9a186e409b24" facs="#m-018005a5-9c2c-48c7-80f9-d7b557ae46b8" label="lyrics-like">4. Técum princípium in die virtútis túae in splendóribus sanetó¬</l><l xml:id="m-6bef9c80-7af2-432f-903d-b5210604b259" facs="#m-7f093113-5dfe-4540-8913-109c5c178d9b" label="lyrics-like">rum:*ex útero ante lucíferum génui te.</l><l xml:id="m-873cd319-158c-4b6b-af1d-6d3d2fd450fa" facs="#m-c6cc6e69-6bf2-4557-a0e5-e74f0f9f4830" label="lyrics-like">5. Jurávit Dóminus, et non paenitébit éum: “Tu es sacérdos in</l><l xml:id="m-3dccf1cd-fbb6-455d-8a25-722890b75e1c" facs="#m-f913a6b4-f275-4f60-9476-06ed0e3162b7" label="lyrics-like">actérnum secúndum órdinem Melchisedech.</l><l xml:id="m-4e8b434d-8b73-4e2c-a9c2-196062cc7b36" facs="#m-ecfe3f66-487a-4b73-aa67-5d788c88e91f" label="lyrics-like">6. Dóminus a déxtris túis, confrégit in die irae súce réges.</l><l xml:id="m-ce3d68c9-0566-456b-88fa-b431f9d295bb" facs="#m-cf05b608-293c-4ef2-bc42-9585a61e038e" label="lyrics-like">7. Judicábit in natiónibus, implébit ruinas: “conquassábit cápita in</l><l xml:id="m-8d278f8b-0f67-43c1-b257-9efa3f115917" facs="#m-718e3e26-1855-4119-bb3a-ed0d5f192fdb" label="lyrics-like">terra multórum.</l><l xml:id="m-5bb0587b-9aa8-484e-ba35-fc789cba1126" facs="#m-12afae6d-6cbd-40e6-80fa-8e18dd4742a6" label="lyrics-like">8. De torrénte in via bibet: “proptérea exaltábit eáput.</l><l xml:id="m-ac0425ae-fca1-4224-8292-f140b3b31bd6" facs="#m-af000ca0-c245-4f09-845d-f05ca9b74958" label="lyrics-like">9. Glória Pâtri, et Fillo, * et Spiritut Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-58bbe022-3b97-455b-a86d-f8ec31ab144a" facs="#m-3a6f782b-5723-4a3c-965f-d9219759fb3d" label="lyrics-like">10. Sicut érat in principio, et núne, et sémper, " et in saécula saccu¬</l><l xml:id="m-6b0cd031-e86d-4fb7-a4bb-484fe12aafc4" facs="#m-508624f5-2334-4cc5-bfa4-94aea5645e9a" label="lyrics-like">lóram. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-b8993f51-2c27-4f7c-a005-339df3b35240" facs="#m-11b38083-5d85-4333-9332-541e4d1f5354" label="ambiguous">Tone 4. E, A. A".</l><l xml:id="m-2cd39789-864d-4edb-8128-331498543495" facs="#m-d0667d54-7092-4119-9eb5-866612772e8f" label="text-like">Mediant of 1 accent with 2 notes in Endings of 1 accent with 3 prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-1d026a38-024e-499d-b4da-e4e15f660af6" facs="#m-783686cf-70f3-4edd-98c1-0f2d0586f0ad" label="lyrics-like">tory syllables. (For the ending É, an</l><l xml:id="m-afb88b36-e59d-4dc8-86bd-385bfb973eae" facs="#m-fa7fa570-d6b7-4e68-9495-50e54d9690de" label="ambiguous">preparation.</l><l xml:id="m-9f492eed-b9c7-4e57-b743-3e24d9ef0f5a" facs="#m-882fe78c-3b3d-4e15-8f83-42f77857c6d2" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation ot</l><l xml:id="m-035e436f-2d66-4e1a-9574-cb9594b2a50c" facs="#m-99b0fed3-3cf2-468d-8b5e-8321dcb4bac8" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadences</l><l xml:id="m-6f970e47-f8c8-45d5-93c2-7df860ade5a9" facs="#m-2efddc26-0874-4547-aaf9-3e13888ebb19" label="ambiguous">— E</l><l xml:id="m-c7003b82-7ec8-4608-8ade-aff0fb9c000d" facs="#m-13290fff-7726-4f09-9a21-678b30b0bdae" label="lyrics-like">:" Séde a dextris</l><l xml:id="m-4757abf7-2f23-434d-8b90-ae15b38cd534" facs="#m-a2fc5db9-13c3-4caf-9b3a-c425899aae71" label="lyrics-like">mé-is.</l><l xml:id="m-10b46d46-5520-4a76-8815-3c5e33827dbe" facs="#m-4f4e1010-9b5d-421e-9d77-88c7bbfeb9a8" label="lyrics-like">1. Dixit Dóminus Dómino mé¬</l></lg>
